  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pes 305.04 Examination Required for Restricted Use Permit. All private applicators desiring to be certified to use state restricted use pesticides shall take a written examination as set forth in Pes 305.06.\n\nSource. #4867, eff 7-19-90; ss by #6258, eff 5-30-96; ss by #8059, eff 5-30-04; ss by #10198-B, eff 10-3-12; ss by #13363, eff 6-1-22, EXPIRES: 6-1-32",
